# LaTeX intermediates and the locally built data generator. report.pdf and the
# figures are committed: the report is meant to be read without a LaTeX
# installation, and the figures are what report.tex includes.
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
report_data

# The repository ignores *.csv, which is right for simulation output but not for
# the measurements this report plots: those are inputs to the figures and are
# meant to be versioned with them.
!figures/data/*.csv
